==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

